{"video": "estalar-dedos", "titulo": "Por que o dedo estala?", "fps": 30, "durationInFrames": 1800, "durationSeconds": 60.0, "engine": "kokoro", "voz": {"estilo": "documentario", "ritmo": 0.9}, "scenes": [{"id": "gancho", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 0, "endFrame": 78, "lines": [{"text": "Por que o dedo estala?", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 57, "words": [{"text": "Por", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 11}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 11, "endFrame": 20}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 20, "endFrame": 22}, {"text": "dedo", "startFrame": 22, "endFrame": 37}, {"text": "estala?", "startFrame": 37, "endFrame": 57}]}]}, {"id": "dentro", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 78, "endFrame": 340, "lines": [{"text": "Dentro da junta do dedo tem um líquido que funciona como óleo.", "startFrame": 99, "endFrame": 225, "words": [{"text": "Dentro", "startFrame": 99, "endFrame": 114}, {"text": "da", "startFrame": 114, "endFrame": 117}, {"text": "junta", "startFrame": 117, "endFrame": 129}, {"text": "do", "startFrame": 129, "endFrame": 134}, {"text": "dedo", "startFrame": 134, "endFrame": 142}, {"text": "tem", "startFrame": 142, "endFrame": 150}, {"text": "um", "startFrame": 154, "endFrame": 158}, {"text": "líquido", "startFrame": 158, "endFrame": 178}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 178, "endFrame": 181}, {"text": "funciona", "startFrame": 181, "endFrame": 202}, {"text": "como", "startFrame": 202, "endFrame": 214}, {"text": "óleo.", "startFrame": 214, "endFrame": 225}]}, {"text": "Ele deixa tudo deslizando liso.", "startFrame": 236, "endFrame": 319, "words": [{"text": "Ele", "startFrame": 236, "endFrame": 246}, {"text": "deixa", "startFrame": 246, "endFrame": 259}, {"text": "tudo", "startFrame": 264, "endFrame": 278}, {"text": "deslizando", "startFrame": 278, "endFrame": 308}, {"text": "liso.", "startFrame": 308, "endFrame": 319}]}]}, {"id": "ventosa", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 340, "endFrame": 688, "lines": [{"text": "Quando você puxa o dedo, os ossos se afastam…", "startFrame": 362, "endFrame": 459, "words": [{"text": "Quando", "startFrame": 362, "endFrame": 378}, {"text": "você", "startFrame": 378, "endFrame": 385}, {"text": "puxa", "startFrame": 385, "endFrame": 396}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 396, "endFrame": 402}, {"text": "dedo,", "startFrame": 402, "endFrame": 409}, {"text": "os", "startFrame": 414, "endFrame": 419}, {"text": "ossos", "startFrame": 419, "endFrame": 430}, {"text": "se", "startFrame": 430, "endFrame": 434}, {"text": "afastam…", "startFrame": 434, "endFrame": 459}]}, {"text": "e abre, de repente, uma bolha de gás nesse líquido. Tipo ventosa saindo do vidro: ploc!", "startFrame": 470, "endFrame": 666, "words": [{"text": "e", "startFrame": 470, "endFrame": 478}, {"text": "abre,", "startFrame": 478, "endFrame": 496}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 498, "endFrame": 513}, {"text": "repente,", "startFrame": 513, "endFrame": 560}, {"text": "uma", "startFrame": 563, "endFrame": 564}, {"text": "bolha", "startFrame": 564, "endFrame": 565}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 565, "endFrame": 566}, {"text": "gás", "startFrame": 566, "endFrame": 567}, {"text": "nesse", "startFrame": 567, "endFrame": 568}, {"text": "líquido.", "startFrame": 568, "endFrame": 570}, {"text": "Tipo", "startFrame": 582, "endFrame": 593}, {"text": "ventosa", "startFrame": 593, "endFrame": 614}, {"text": "saindo", "startFrame": 614, "endFrame": 630}, {"text": "do", "startFrame": 630, "endFrame": 633}, {"text": "vidro:", "startFrame": 633, "endFrame": 645}, {"text": "ploc!", "startFrame": 650, "endFrame": 667}]}]}, {"id": "mri", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 688, "endFrame": 878, "lines": [{"text": "Cientistas filmaram isso numa ressonância, ao vivo, em 2015!", "startFrame": 709, "endFrame": 856, "words": [{"text": "Cientistas", "startFrame": 709, "endFrame": 726}, {"text": "filmaram", "startFrame": 726, "endFrame": 746}, {"text": "isso", "startFrame": 746, "endFrame": 754}, {"text": "numa", "startFrame": 754, "endFrame": 763}, {"text": "ressonância,", "startFrame": 763, "endFrame": 788}, {"text": "ao", "startFrame": 794, "endFrame": 808}, {"text": "vivo,", "startFrame": 808, "endFrame": 837}, {"text": "em", "startFrame": 839, "endFrame": 847}, {"text": "2015!", "startFrame": 847, "endFrame": 856}]}]}, {"id": "espera", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 878, "endFrame": 1077, "lines": [{"text": "E depois do estalo, o mesmo dedo leva uns vinte minutos pra estalar de novo.", "startFrame": 899, "endFrame": 1055, "words": [{"text": "E", "startFrame": 899, "endFrame": 904}, {"text": "depois", "startFrame": 904, "endFrame": 917}, {"text": "do", "startFrame": 917, "endFrame": 924}, {"text": "estalo,", "startFrame": 924, "endFrame": 936}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 944, "endFrame": 946}, {"text": "mesmo", "startFrame": 946, "endFrame": 960}, {"text": "dedo", "startFrame": 960, "endFrame": 968}, {"text": "leva", "startFrame": 968, "endFrame": 980}, {"text": "uns", "startFrame": 980, "endFrame": 988}, {"text": "vinte", "startFrame": 988, "endFrame": 998}, {"text": "minutos", "startFrame": 998, "endFrame": 1016}, {"text": "pra", "startFrame": 1016, "endFrame": 1024}, {"text": "estalar", "startFrame": 1024, "endFrame": 1038}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 1038, "endFrame": 1047}, {"text": "novo.", "startFrame": 1047, "endFrame": 1055}]}]}, {"id": "artrite", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 1077, "endFrame": 1428, "lines": [{"text": "Dá artrite? Um médico estalou só uma das mãos por uns sessenta anos.", "startFrame": 1098, "endFrame": 1247, "words": [{"text": "Dá", "startFrame": 1098, "endFrame": 1105}, {"text": "artrite?", "startFrame": 1105, "endFrame": 1123}, {"text": "Um", "startFrame": 1129, "endFrame": 1136}, {"text": "médico", "startFrame": 1136, "endFrame": 1150}, {"text": "estalou", "startFrame": 1150, "endFrame": 1168}, {"text": "só", "startFrame": 1168, "endFrame": 1173}, {"text": "uma", "startFrame": 1173, "endFrame": 1182}, {"text": "das", "startFrame": 1182, "endFrame": 1186}, {"text": "mãos", "startFrame": 1186, "endFrame": 1201}, {"text": "por", "startFrame": 1201, "endFrame": 1205}, {"text": "uns", "startFrame": 1205, "endFrame": 1216}, {"text": "sessenta", "startFrame": 1216, "endFrame": 1237}, {"text": "anos.", "startFrame": 1237, "endFrame": 1247}]}, {"text": "Resultado: nenhuma das duas teve artrite. E ele ainda ganhou um prêmio!", "startFrame": 1259, "endFrame": 1406, "words": [{"text": "Resultado:", "startFrame": 1259, "endFrame": 1270}, {"text": "nenhuma", "startFrame": 1273, "endFrame": 1292}, {"text": "das", "startFrame": 1292, "endFrame": 1299}, {"text": "duas", "startFrame": 1299, "endFrame": 1308}, {"text": "teve", "startFrame": 1308, "endFrame": 1320}, {"text": "artrite.", "startFrame": 1320, "endFrame": 1344}, {"text": "E", "startFrame": 1352, "endFrame": 1356}, {"text": "ele", "startFrame": 1356, "endFrame": 1363}, {"text": "ainda", "startFrame": 1363, "endFrame": 1376}, {"text": "ganhou", "startFrame": 1376, "endFrame": 1388}, {"text": "um", "startFrame": 1388, "endFrame": 1396}, {"text": "prêmio!", "startFrame": 1396, "endFrame": 1406}]}]}, {"id": "conclusao", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 1428, "endFrame": 1800, "lines": [{"text": "Resumindo: estalar o dedo é tipo abrir pote de pepino: ploc! E depois tem que esperar a tampa fechar.", "startFrame": 1449, "endFrame": 1658, "words": [{"text": "Resumindo:", "startFrame": 1449, "endFrame": 1521}, {"text": "estalar", "startFrame": 1524, "endFrame": 1529}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 1529, "endFrame": 1531}, {"text": "dedo", "startFrame": 1531, "endFrame": 1534}, {"text": "é", "startFrame": 1534, "endFrame": 1537}, {"text": "tipo", "startFrame": 1537, "endFrame": 1538}, {"text": "abrir", "startFrame": 1538, "endFrame": 1543}, {"text": "pote", "startFrame": 1543, "endFrame": 1546}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 1546, "endFrame": 1550}, {"text": "pepino:", "startFrame": 1550, "endFrame": 1554}, {"text": "ploc!", "startFrame": 1561, "endFrame": 1572}, {"text": "E", "startFrame": 1582, "endFrame": 1585}, {"text": "depois", "startFrame": 158